      "description": "Picking up a Yumemi Style Special Snack from the Elemental Burst Anraku Secret Spring Therapy will both deal DMG and heal. It will also heal a nearby party member with lower HP for 266% of Yumemizuki Mizuki's Elemental Mastery, as well as regenerate 5 Energy for Yumemizuki Mizuki. Energy can be restored this way 4 times per Anraku Secret Spring Therapy duration."
