    {
      "level": 6,
      "name": "6. The Heart Lingers Long",
      "description": "While Yumemizuki Mizuki is in the Dreamdrifter state, Swirl DMG dealt by nearby party members can score CRIT Hits, with CRIT Rate fixed at 30%, and CRIT DMG fixed at 100%. The CRIT Rate of any Stellar Swirl DMG dealt by these party members is also increased by 10%, while CRIT DMG is increased by 20%.\nEvery point of Elemental Mastery Yumemizuki Mizuki has in excess of 500 increases her CRIT Rate by 0.04% and her CRIT DMG by 0.16%. Yumemizuki Mizuki's CRIT Rate and CRIT DMG can be increased by up to 20% and 80% in this way, respectively."
